ssues/100509","id":2654322998,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eNcE2","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-12T16:57:29Z","updated_at":"2026-02-12T22:57:23Z","body":"We discussed this problem in a core meeting.\n\nThe verdict was the following:\n\n- Let's just assume **everything** is trivially relocatable.\n    - Feel free to use performance optimizations assuming trivial relocatability (like `realloc` or `memmove`).\n- If we find something that isn't trivially relocatable, then we should make it trivially relocatable.\n    - If we find something that _needs to be_ non trivially relocatable, then reconsider.\n\nNot sure whether to leave the Issue open, or just close it (and reopen if it becomes relevant).\n\nEdit: I'm closing this issue as there is nothing more to do. We can continue referring to it or discuss when it is relevant.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2654322998/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]